{"id":"v0s9fxnpyisofyza4kzjwa931","title":"斯坦纳教育与主流教育对比研究","originalTitle":"Steiner and state: Comparing two schools of thought","summary":"新国际研究发现，接受斯坦纳教育的学生在阅读、英语和科学等多门学科中表现出更高的学术成就，并且更积极地感受到学校和课堂环境。这项研究分析了来自11个国家的约8,000名斯坦纳学校学生和188,000名主流学校学生的数据，覆盖不同国家、年龄和学校类型。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-steiner-state-schools-thought.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T14:00:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:38.541Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:38.541Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果"],"score":42,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"17e93b0b-b352-4dd7-9de0-2e4831aece8c","title":"国际比较研究显示斯坦纳教育学生学术表现更优"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"17e93b0b-b352-4dd7-9de0-2e4831aece8c","title":"国际比较研究显示斯坦纳教育学生学术表现更优"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fhRMs4-Y4s4U","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}